-
-The v0.10 Bass continuum remains:
-
-```text
-SILENT
-  ↓
-ANCHOR
-  ↓
-FOUNDATION
-  ↓
-MOVING
-  ↓
-CONNECT
-```
-
-Vocabulary still includes:
