-## Phrase Editor grid
-
-Unchanged from v0.10:
-
-```text
-1/16 | 1/8 | 1/4 | 1/2 | BEAT | BAR
-```
-
-Shorten/Extend snaps down/up to the adjacent grid boundary instead of adding an
-increment to an already off-grid value.
-
-Example in 4/4:
-
-```text
-duration = 4.1 bars
